        <mxCell id="ct1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=3;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" value="GitHub (outside AWS)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="55" width="787" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ct2" parent="1" style="points=[[0,0],[0.25,0],[0.5,0],[0.75,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[1,0.5],[1,0.75],[1,1],[0.75,1],[0.5,1],[0.25,1],[0,1],[0,0.75],[0,0.5],[0,0.25]];outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;container=0;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shape=mxgraph.aws4.group;grIcon=mxgraph.aws4.group_aws_cloud_alt;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;fontColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" value="AWS member account (per environment) — develop → stark-dev (live) · main → stark-prod (protected contract, evidence only)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="285" width="787" height="1185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#B3B3B3;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; — Terraform ownership: unmarked = bootstrap root (deployment control) · (foundation) / (app) as marked.&lt;br&gt;Solid arrow = pipeline execution / artifact flow · Dashed arrow = identity / trigger / reference · Dotted line without arrowhead = lane detail callout (same CodePipeline family, not an invocation). Small arcs are line jumps over unrelated connectors.&lt;br&gt;Accounts: management = Organizations / billing / guardrails only (no workloads). CodePipeline has no webhook auto-start (CodeConnections DetectChanges=false); a develop push matching the frontend path allowlist runs GitHub Actions, which starts the app static-fast lane via OIDC. Operators start every other lane.&lt;br&gt;Omitted: per-stage IAM deploy roles, CodeBuild log groups, artifact bucket wiring." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="1485" width="787" height="118" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d1" parent="1" style="dashed=0;outlineConnect=0;html=1;align=center;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;shape=mxgraph.weblogos.github;aspect=fixed;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub repository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;branches: develop · main&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="95" width="56" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;CI evidence: lint · type-check · tests · e2e · Rust · formal · public safety&lt;br&gt;Deploy trigger: OIDC token (branch-scoped sub)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="95" width="330" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d3" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#C925D1;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.codestar;" value="&lt;b&gt;CodeConnections (GitHub)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;shared source connection&lt;br&gt;no webhook (DetectChanges=false)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128" y="330" width="60" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#DD344C;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.identity_and_access_management;" value="&lt;b&gt;IAM GitHub trigger roles&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;StartPipelineExecution + observe only&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="390" y="330" width="60" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d5" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;shape=mxgraph.aws4.user;" value="&lt;b&gt;Operator (human)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;starts other lanes&lt;br&gt;decides ★ manual approvals&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="330" width="56" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C925D1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;AWS CodePipeline — deployment lanes (V2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;• bootstrap · foundation: guarded Terraform shape&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(Source → Validate → Plan → ★ Manual approval → Apply → Smoke)&lt;br&gt;• app: full guarded Terraform lane (detailed below)&lt;br&gt;• app static-fast: frontend-only · path-allowlisted · no Terraform / state access&lt;br&gt;• prover image release: ★ build approval → candidate build → ★ promotion (detailed below)&lt;br&gt;• toolchain image release: RISC Zero base image · ★ build approval → candidate build → ★ promotion (detailed below)&lt;br&gt;• release-candidate: preflight checks only&lt;br&gt;Build / plan / apply / smoke stages run as CodeBuild jobs · artifact buckets per lane family (S3 + KMS)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="478" width="727" height="152" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d6icon" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#C925D1;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.codepipeline;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="743" y="486" width="26" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C925D1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;App lane (guarded Terraform)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1. Source (current control branch / SHA)&lt;br&gt;2. Generate deployment record — normal: immutable record from accepted release pointers · rollback: select retained accepted deployment&lt;br&gt;3. Validate release / deployable authority&lt;br&gt;4. Terraform plan — saved plan binds mode + optional four-phase DynamoDB recovery selection&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#CC0000&quot;&gt;5. ★ Manual approval — skipped only for a develop normal run with machine-proven empty plan; rollback and protected production always require approval&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. Terraform apply — reviewed saved plan only&lt;br&gt;7. Static frontend deploy — build → S3 sync → CloudFront invalidation&lt;br&gt;8. Post-apply smoke → publish immutable acceptance evidence · CAS accepted-deployment index&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="665" width="350" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d7icon" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#C925D1;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.codepipeline;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="366" y="671" width="26" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d8" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C925D1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Prover image release lane&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1. Source (optional pinned SHA · default branch head)&lt;br&gt;2. Resolve toolchain authority (accepted pointer)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#CC0000&quot;&gt;3. ★ Build approval — fires the candidate build&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Build prover candidate — ARM64 CodeBuild · ImageID / methodVersion · ECR push · scan gate · Signer COMPLETE&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#CC0000&quot;&gt;5. ★ Manual approval — prover promotion&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. Publish promotion evidence&lt;br&gt;7. Update accepted pointer (CAS)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="875" width="347" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d8icon" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#C925D1;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.codepipeline;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="743" y="881" width="26" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d14" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C925D1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Toolchain image release lane (rare)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1. Source (optional pinned SHA · default branch head)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#CC0000&quot;&gt;2. ★ Build approval — fires the ~2h candidate build&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Build toolchain candidate — ARM64 CodeBuild · ECR push (toolchain repo) · warn-only scan · Signer COMPLETE&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#CC0000&quot;&gt;4. ★ Manual approval — promotion (findings require a scan waiver)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. Publish promotion evidence&lt;br&gt;6. Update accepted pointer (CAS) → release manifests&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="665" width="347" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d14icon" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#C925D1;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.codepipeline;" value="" vertex="1">
